":{"exact":"e5ab0578ef76a298a546160871edfe84a96622805f32a9aef1586bd3d881595a","compact":"8ad470df6a862bae08f9a8767611f35b05350313e38c3606ca33e3826debc84f","nasal":"483e8a35a7bed3625929139e205f6d7b6f3f8b4bd55cb210579c00bd19be4b4a"}},{"id":"VRCE-4-6-23","kanda":4,"kandaId":"kishkindha","sarga":6,"verse":23,"english":"Tell me all about that ranger of the night, that deceitfully has carried away my dearest wife from the forest. My foe, O lord of monkey will I to-day send to the neighbourhood of Yāma.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.884,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-4-6-21"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"4006023","sanskritFile":"Ram04.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"7fc7ab11fec10df6f1d17a42de36b3ef9a91a4da8b61ace237e27d2dcef58e22","compact":"d68db59e8f97324a800ce84a305f4d84251baebd1093de0f9fc77079f72943cf","nasal":"d68db59e8f97324a800ce84a305f4d84251baebd1093de0f9fc77079f72943cf"}}]
